# L §5.14.3: "Only the engine makes adjustments: a move or an observed row of kind adjustments, or of a subkind of it,
# is refused (LOAD-KIND)." (Writer 6: was LOAD-LEG.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input rows: observed

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  rows[r1] = (on: 2026-03-01, kind: adjustments, leg cash from world to konto amount 10 PLN, adjusts: x, of_leg: "cash", change: 10 PLN) "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KIND ...
